<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 100 mln mark 30-year FRN.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 100 mln mark 30-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley Bank AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   BASE	 **	  MATURITY    16.DEC.26</p>
<p> TYPE   REVERSE FRN   MARGIN     **	  PAY DATE    16.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA1	 ISS PRICE  102.30    FULL FEES   3.00</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA+	 REOFFER    99.80</p>
<p>NOTES  **  10 PCT FOR FIRST FIVE YEARS, THEN 17.5 PCT MINUS</p>
<p>		(6MONTH LIBOR TIMES TWO)</p>
<p> LISTING    FFURT     DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50 PCT  SELL CONC  2.50 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSSUED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
